{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">54歲的黎姿近日遠赴歐洲度假，期間不忘在社交平台上分享多張泳裝美照，大方為粉絲送上福利。從照片中可見，黎姿登上遊艇出海，悠閒地享受日光浴，畫面相當愜意。而當中最令人矚目的，莫過於她穿上泳裝上陣，展現出令人稱羨的逆齡完美體態！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-28 at 3.55.37 PM.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026dEEz4unSde1785225532.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-07-28 at 3.55.37 PM.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-28 at 3.55.55 PM.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026MK1iIPXsM81785225537.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-07-28 at 3.55.55 PM.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在其中一張照片中，黎姿以性感大露背造型入鏡，大方展露迷人背肌；另一張背影照同樣極具視覺衝擊力，一雙纖細筆直的修長美腿，加上零贅肉的完美身段一覽無遺。配合她標誌性的甜美笑容，瞬間迷倒大批網民。大家紛紛留言讚嘆：「依然美麗」、「生完3個孩子依然這麼漂亮」、「充滿陽光與健康氣息」！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-01T08:02:06.487745+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}